{
 "hook-1": {
  "audioSec": 4.967,
  "audioFrames": 149,
  "duration": 157,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "你下单付了钱，页面显示成功，仓库却根本没扣库存。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.968,
    "src": "ch1-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "hook-2": {
  "audioSec": 6.8,
  "audioFrames": 204,
  "duration": 222,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 157,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "原来订单和库存记在不同的数据库里，各记各的，一个成了，另一个没成。",
    "start": 0.015,
    "dur": 6.791,
    "src": "ch1-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "signal-1": {
  "audioSec": 6.2,
  "audioFrames": 186,
  "duration": 195,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "signal",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "不同库里的数据，怎么做到一起成功、一起失败？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.709,
    "src": "ch2-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "马上说清楚。",
    "start": 4.989,
    "dur": 1.223,
    "src": "ch2-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "signal-2": {
  "audioSec": 4.533,
  "audioFrames": 136,
  "duration": 154,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 195,
  "chapter": "signal",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "把这些库想成驿站：红站记订单，蓝站管货架。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.536,
    "src": "ch2-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "local-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.667,
  "audioFrames": 290,
  "duration": 298,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "local",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "同一个库里，一笔事务能全部撤回；可数据分到不同的库以后，每个站只能撤回自己账本上的字，管不到对方的货架。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.659,
    "src": "ch3-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "local-2": {
  "audioSec": 2.567,
  "audioFrames": 77,
  "duration": 95,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 298,
  "chapter": "local",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "所以得有人在中间统一指挥。",
    "start": 0.006,
    "dur": 2.551,
    "src": "ch3-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "prepare-1": {
  "audioSec": 6.867,
  "audioFrames": 206,
  "duration": 214,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "prepare",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "以 MySQL 八点四为例，每个库都能听一个拿对讲机的调度员指挥。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.85,
    "src": "ch4-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "prepare-2": {
  "audioSec": 8.3,
  "audioFrames": 249,
  "duration": 267,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 214,
  "chapter": "prepare",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "他先挨个问：准备好了吗？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.272,
    "src": "ch4-2"
   },
   {
    "text": "红站用铅笔写好订单，先不盖章；蓝站把货挪进待出库的格子锁住。",
    "start": 2.549,
    "dur": 5.745,
    "src": "ch4-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "commit-1": {
  "audioSec": 7.567,
  "audioFrames": 227,
  "duration": 235,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "commit",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "红站蓝站都举绿牌，调度员才喊一起盖章；只要有一个站举红牌，就喊全部擦掉。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.561,
    "src": "ch5-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "commit-2": {
  "audioSec": 4.8,
  "audioFrames": 144,
  "duration": 198,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 235,
  "chapter": "commit",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "先准备、再统一生效，这叫两阶段提交。",
    "start": 0.008,
    "dur": 4.797,
    "src": "ch5-2"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 162,
  "holdAt": 162,
  "extraHold": 36,
  "labelHold": 36
 },
 "stuck-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.033,
  "audioFrames": 271,
  "duration": 289,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "stuck",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "它也有代价：对讲机要是突然没声了，红站拿着铅笔单，蓝站锁着货，既不敢盖章也不敢擦，只能干等。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.029,
    "src": "ch6-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "message-1": {
  "audioSec": 2.233,
  "audioFrames": 67,
  "duration": 75,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "message",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "另一种办法不找调度员。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.222,
    "src": "ch7-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "message-2": {
  "audioSec": 9.7,
  "audioFrames": 291,
  "duration": 300,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 75,
  "chapter": "message",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "红站在同一页账上，同时写下订单和一张通知仓库的条子；跑腿员拿着条子一趟趟跑，直到蓝站签收。",
    "start": 0.002,
    "dur": 9.71,
    "src": "ch7-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "message-3": {
  "audioSec": 5.033,
  "audioFrames": 151,
  "duration": 218,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 375,
  "chapter": "message",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "蓝站认单号，重复送来的不再扣。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.157,
    "src": "ch7-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "这就是可靠消息。",
    "start": 3.429,
    "dur": 1.593,
    "src": "ch7-4"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 168,
  "holdAt": 168,
  "extraHold": 50,
  "labelHold": 50
 },
 "eventual-1": {
  "audioSec": 6.5,
  "audioFrames": 195,
  "duration": 262,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "eventual",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "中间会有一小段时间，订单和库存对不上，但最后一定对上，这叫最终一致。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.49,
    "src": "ch8-1"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 213,
  "holdAt": 213,
  "extraHold": 49,
  "labelHold": 49
 },
 "recap-1": {
  "audioSec": 11.4,
  "audioFrames": 342,
  "duration": 403,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "数据分在不同的库里，要么等大家都说好再一起生效，稳但慢；要么先记下来，再保证送到，快但中间会短暂对不上。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.096,
    "src": "ch9-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "这就是分布式事务。",
    "start": 9.376,
    "dur": 2.032,
    "src": "ch9-2"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 402,
  "holdAt": 402,
  "extraHold": 1,
  "labelHold": 1
 }
}